public class Patient{private long id;private String last;private String first;private String middle;private String address;private String phone;private long card;private String diagnosis;public Patient(long id,String last,String first,String middle,String address,String phone,long card,String diagnosis){this.id=id;this.last=last;this.first=first;this.middle=middle;this.address=address;this.phone=phone;this.card=card;this.diagnosis=diagnosis;}public Patient(long id,String last){this(id,last,"F","M","A","1",1,"D");}public long id(){return id;}public void id(long value){id=value;}public String last(){return last;}public void last(String value){last=value;}public String first(){return first;}public void first(String value){first=value;}public String middle(){return middle;}public void middle(String value){middle=value;}public String address(){return address;}public void address(String value){address=value;}public String phone(){return phone;}public void phone(String value){phone=value;}public long card(){return card;}public void card(long value){card=value;}public String diagnosis(){return diagnosis;}public void diagnosis(String value){diagnosis=value;}public String toString(){return id+"|"+last+"|"+first+"|"+middle+"|"+address+"|"+phone+"|"+card+"|"+diagnosis;}public static Patient[]diagnosis(Patient[]a,String match){int count=0;for(Patient p:a)if(p.diagnosis.equals(match))count++;Patient[]out=new Patient[count];int i=0;for(Patient p:a)if(p.diagnosis.equals(match))out[i++]=p;return out;}public static Patient[]range(Patient[]a,long lo,long hi){int count=0;for(Patient p:a)if(p.card>lo&&p.card<hi)count++;Patient[]out=new Patient[count];int i=0;for(Patient p:a)if(p.card>lo&&p.card<hi)out[i++]=p;return out;}}
